# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

Only the latest version of this portfolio is supported with security updates.

| Version | Supported          |
| ------- | ------------------ |
| Latest  | :white_check_mark: |
| < Latest| :x:                |

## Reporting a Vulnerability

If you find a security vulnerability, please report it privately by emailing [umery101@gmail.com](mailto:umery101@gmail.com).

I will do my best to respond and address the issue as quickly as possible.
